# This repository tracks only coordination files located directly at its root.
#
# Every immediate child directory is an independent repository, experiment,
# local-only workspace, generated tree, or archive. The parent repository must
# treat those directories as opaque and must never recursively stage them.
/*/

# The versioned GitHub Pages runtime is the one deliberate child directory:
# index.html owns the public API while private WASM regions are fetched lazily
# from site/v1/. All project/workspace directories remain opaque.
!/site/

# Archive/quarantine names are called out explicitly for human readers. These
# rules are redundant with /*/ at the root, but document the safety boundary.
/_quarantine/
/archive/
/archives/

# Root-local machine and editor debris. Add individual root files here only
# when they should never be part of the coordination repository.
/*.log
/*.tmp
/*.bak
/*.zip
/.DS_Store
/Thumbs.db
